---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — HueForge"
	description="HueForge's privacy policy: how the client-side color palette generator handles your input (it never uploads it) and what minimal analytics/advertising data may be collected."
	canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#8A7E68]">Last updated {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#5C4F3D]">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2B2013]">Your colors</h2>
			<p>
				HueForge generates palettes entirely within your web browser using
				client-side JavaScript. Any color you type or pick is never
				uploaded to any server &mdash; it is processed directly by your
				browser and the resulting palette is rendered on-screen. We have
				no access to, and keep no copy of, any color you enter.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2B2013]">Cookies and analytics</h2>
			<p>
				We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand aggregate,
				anonymized traffic (for example, how many people visit the site and
				which pages they use), and third-party advertising (such as Google
				AdSense) to keep the tool free. These services may use cookies or
				similar technologies as described in their own privacy policies.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2B2013]">Advertising</h2>
			<p>
				This site may display ads served by third-party vendors, including
				Google. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its
				partners to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other
				sites on the internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising
				by visiting
				<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-[#C9982E] underline hover:text-[#B8860B]">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2B2013]">Contact</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about this policy, you can reach out via the
				contact details listed on our homepage.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
